        <item>
            <title>0.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 21:54:40 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.6.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Stash 0.6.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>A new look.</strong> Stash borrows from spacefast.com now: Spacefast's typeface, a rounded panel, and your tabs in a track with a green pill that slides between them. Light and dark both.</li>
  <li><strong>Little thumbnails in the list,</strong> so you can spot a Space without switching to the grid.</li>
  <li><strong>Hover actions in one bar.</strong> Star, copy the link, or open the dashboard from a single strip that stays readable over any screenshot.</li>
  <li><strong>Some fun.</strong> Cards tip when you pick them up, stars pop when you favorite (and wobble when you don't), copying a link earns a sticker, and your newest Space gets a "fresh" one.</li>
  <li><strong>Everything up top.</strong> Dashboard and settings moved into the header, so the footer's gone and the list gets the room.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
