        <item>
            <title>0.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:01:48 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.5.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Stash 0.5.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Opens at login.</strong> Stash is there after a restart. Turn it off in the settings menu.</li>
  <li><strong>Sharper dark thumbnails.</strong> They come from Spacefast's screenshot service now, private Spaces included, instead of loading each Space in the background.</li>
  <li><strong>No more "Generating Preview".</strong> Fresh screenshots fill in on their own.</li>
  <li><strong>Sign out tells you</strong> if the key couldn't be revoked.</li>
  <li><strong>An app icon</strong>, so Stash stops looking like a blank app in Finder.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
