            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Stash 0.4.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Discover.</strong> A new last tab with the Spaces people are sharing on Spacefast. New ones since your last look get a dot.</li>
  <li><strong>Remix</strong> from the right-click menu, where a Space allows it.</li>
  <li><strong>Not into it?</strong> Turn off Show Discover in the settings menu.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
